content.text:
请对以下 case 进行三维加权评分。

=== case_id ===
Case-15-smart-home-004

=== 用户原始指令 (query.txt) ===
显示本月电费 200 块，点一下跳到缴费

=== TaskSpec 契约 (task.taskSpec.json) ===
{
  "userQuery": "显示本月电费 200 块，点一下跳到缴费",
  "size": "2x2",
  "eventCandidates": [
    {
      "call": "clickToDeeplink",
      "args": {
        "bundleName": "com.huawei.hmos.smarthome",
        "abilityName": "com.huawei.hmos.smarthome.PayAbility",
        "uri": "smarthome://bill/electricity/pay"
      }
    }
  ],
  "dataModelSchema": {
    "bill": {
      "title": {
        "type": "string",
        "description": "电费账单标题",
        "sampleValue": "本月电费"
      },
      "amount": {
        "type": "number",
        "description": "本月待缴电费金额，单位为元",
        "sampleValue": 200
      },
      "statusLabel": {
        "type": "string",
        "description": "当前电费账单状态短标签",
        "sampleValue": "待缴"
      }
    },
    "action": {
      "payLabel": {
        "type": "string",
        "description": "缴费动作的短标签",
        "sampleValue": "去缴费"
      }
    }
  },
  "assetCandidates": [
    {
      "src": "resources/base/media/bolt_fill.svg",
      "description": "闪电实心图标，适合表示用电、电费或电力账单。"
    }
  ]
}

=== 待评审 DSL (card.dsl.jsonl，共 3 行) ===
{"version":"v0.9","createSurface":{"surfaceId":"surface_card","catalogId":"ohos.a2ui.extended.catalog","width":140,"height":140}}
{"version":"v0.9","updateComponents":{"surfaceId":"surface_card","root":"root","components":[{"id":"root","component":"Column","children":["header_row","primary_value","divider_line","footer_row"],"itemMargin":6,"styles":{"width":140,"height":140,"padding":12,"borderRadius":18,"clip":true,"backgroundColor":"#ffffffff","justifyContent":"start","alignItems":"start"}},{"id":"header_row","component":"Row","children":["bill_icon","title_text"],"itemMargin":4,"styles":{"width":116,"height":22,"alignItems":"center","justifyContent":"start"}},{"id":"bill_icon","component":"Image","src":"resources/base/media/bolt_fill.svg","styles":{"width":18,"height":18,"objectFit":"contain"}},{"id":"title_text","component":"Text","content":"{{ ${/bill/title} }}","styles":{"width":94,"height":20,"fontSize":14,"fontWeight":500,"fontColor":"#e5000000","maxLines":1}},{"id":"primary_value","component":"Text","content":"{{ ${/bill/amount} + '块' }}","styles":{"width":116,"height":40,"fontSize":32,"fontWeight":700,"fontColor":"#e5000000","maxLines":1,"textAlign":"start"}},{"id":"divider_line","component":"Divider","styles":{"width":116,"height":2,"strokeWidth":1,"vertical":false,"color":"#33000000"}},{"id":"footer_row","component":"Row","children":["status_text","action_button"],"itemMargin":6,"styles":{"width":116,"height":32,"alignItems":"center","justifyContent":"start"}},{"id":"status_text","component":"Text","content":"{{ ${/bill/statusLabel} }}","styles":{"width":44,"height":16,"fontSize":12,"fontWeight":400,"fontColor":"#99000000","maxLines":1}},{"id":"action_button","component":"Button","label":"{{ ${/action/payLabel} }}","enabled":true,"onClick":[{"call":"clickToDeeplink","args":{"bundleName":"com.huawei.hmos.smarthome","abilityName":"com.huawei.hmos.smarthome.PayAbility","uri":"smarthome://bill/electricity/pay"}}],"styles":{"width":66,"height":32,"fontSize":14,"fontWeight":500,"fontColor":"#ffffffff","backgroundColor":"#ff0a59f7","borderRadius":16}}]}}
{"version":"v0.9","updateDataModel":{"surfaceId":"surface_card","path":"/","value":{"bill":{"title":"本月电费","amount":200,"statusLabel":"待缴"},"action":{"payLabel":"去缴费"}}}}

=== 渲染截图 ===
⚠️ 本评分以随附的 card.dsl.png 渲染截图为唯一且最终的依据。请务必先认真看图，根据图中实际呈现的效果打分；上面的 DSL 与 system 中的布局公式仅用于协议合规性检查与改进版 DSL 的撰写，绝不能仅凭 DSL 文本/数值给分。排版与美观问题以截图为准。

输出要求：严格按 system 中规定的 JSON schema 输出单个 JSON 对象，reasons 必须基于截图描述具体视觉现象，improved_dsl 为 3 行合法 JSONL。
